# Godot resource UID files
addons/**/*.uid
tests/**/*.uid
# The bootstrap scene's script UID is a committed contract: the scene
# references it and tests/unit/installation_contract_test.gd asserts it
# resolves on a fresh checkout, before Godot's editor import regenerates
# .uid files (which is unreliable on Windows CI).
!addons/gdunit_e2e/runtime/bootstrap.gd.uid
